{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489158,"name":"","username":"Em_Strange","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/ebca7d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:05:38.166Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489158-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489158-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCursor IDE\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489158-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489158-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eafter update from cursor 3.19 to 3.20 , could not use any model , and also in test of network , none worked , 1.1,1.0,2.0 none , so i logged out to log back in and test now , i can’t also log back in , even though i can login fine on the web . but not the IDE , click return to cursor after sign-in , and nothing happens !\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489158-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489158-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eupdate from 3.19 to 3.20 on arch OS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489158-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489158-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003enothing working , can’t re-login so can’t troubleshoot further\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489158-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489158-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/2/a2bb82dec7